WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.453 --> 00:00:03.303
Lesson fifteen. Friendship!

2
00:00:04.209 --> 00:00:11.276
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:14.014
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:17.396
Today we learn: Friendship! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:22.202
Share! Say it with me. Share!

6
00:00:26.186 --> 00:00:29.252
Help! Say it with me. Help!

7
00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:36.717
Kind! Say it with me. Kind!

8
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:44.496
Honest! Say it with me. Honest!

9
00:00:48.412 --> 00:00:51.929
Trust! Say it with me. Trust!

10
00:00:55.962 --> 00:01:00.078
Play together! Say it with me. Play together!

11
00:01:04.052 --> 00:01:07.719
Forgive! Say it with me. Forgive!

12
00:01:11.773 --> 00:01:15.139
Care! Say it with me. Care!

13
00:01:19.157 --> 00:01:24.833
Listen. A good friend shares and helps.

14
00:01:24.883 --> 00:01:28.912
Say it with me. A good friend shares and helps.

15
00:01:33.686 --> 00:01:40.194
Good friends share their things and help each other. Being kind and honest makes friendship strong.

16
00:01:40.244 --> 00:01:41.550
I like this story!

17
00:01:42.315 --> 00:01:47.690
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:48.890
Kind!

19
00:01:49.831 --> 00:01:55.052
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:55.102 --> 00:01:56.393
Play together!

21
00:01:57.375 --> 00:02:03.556
Value corner: Empathy. Understanding how someone else feels helps us be a good friend.

22
00:02:03.606 --> 00:02:05.300
I can show empathy too!

23
00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:13.313
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:13.363 --> 00:02:14.950
Bye-bye, friends!

